      <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://scontent.ftpe7-3.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.6435-9/151841403_4477440942270363_8448583115645363180_n.jpg?_nc_cat=108&amp;amp;ccb=1-7&amp;amp;_nc_sid=1d70fc&amp;amp;_nc_ohc=C8Kti22NVUQQ7kNvgHnCvhf&amp;amp;_nc_ht=scontent.ftpe7-3.fna&amp;amp;oh=00_AYCh13H6OmWL3EZ6Topk0kksdXaBTBn5Uqaa84UTJiyxwQ&amp;amp;oe=66F960D1&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;  /&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hi, I&amp;rsquo;m Yingchao. I&amp;rsquo;m a firmware engineer from Taiwan with a passion for microcontrollers and embedded systems. I&amp;rsquo;ve applied my skills to building micromouse and some hardware/firmware. I&amp;rsquo;m proficient in C, Python, and various build tools like &lt;code&gt;Make&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;CMake&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;Docker&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
